  Cell["A settlement is a permutation matrix. It preserves sums and Euclidean \
norms, so it cannot change this one-step variance identity. It can change \
which persistent pair of field coordinates is averaged later. A list of \
unlabelled graph types therefore does not contain enough information to \
reconstruct the later field values.", "Text", 
   TaggingRules -> <|"GoGComputationalNotes" -> 
      <|"ID" -> "SettlementBoundary", "Generated" -> True|>|>, 
   CellTags -> {"GoGComputationalNotes", "SettlementBoundary"}, 
