       FractionBox[SubscriptBox["C", "A"], RowBox[{"3", "N"}]]}], 
     TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula", TaggingRules -> 
    <|"GoGComputationalNotes" -> <|"ID" -> "RuleAMatrix", 
       "Generated" -> True|>|>, CellTags -> {"GoGComputationalNotes", 
     "RuleAMatrix"}, ExpressionUUID -> 
    "51df2809-8135-8b74-9a44-fb85e1d04ed3", ShowCellBracket -> False, 
   TextAlignment -> Center, FontSize -> 15], Cell["A stationary distribution \
is a probability row vector pi satisfying pi P = pi. The left 1-eigenspace of \
P_A gives it exactly.", "Text", TaggingRules -> 
    <|"GoGComputationalNotes" -> <|"ID" -> "StationaryIntro", 
       "Generated" -> True|>|>, CellTags -> {"GoGComputationalNotes", 
     "StationaryIntro"}, ExpressionUUID -> 
