  Cell["Exact diffusion and a sampled path", "Section", 
   TaggingRules -> <|"GoGComputationalNotes" -> <|"ID" -> "SectionDiffusion", 
       "Generated" -> True|>|>, CellTags -> {"GoGComputationalNotes", 
     "SectionDiffusion"}, ExpressionUUID -> 
    "14910b8e-8022-314e-2ee2-717785d2ef4c"], Cell["Here diffusion means the \
evolution of a probability distribution over graph types: p_t = p_0 P^t. We \
first start at G1 in the five-state N=4 model and apply Rule A four times so \
that every exact probability can be inspected directly.", "Text", 
   TaggingRules -> <|"GoGComputationalNotes" -> <|"ID" -> "DiffusionIntro", 
       "Generated" -> True|>|>, CellTags -> {"GoGComputationalNotes", 
     "DiffusionIntro"}, ExpressionUUID -> 
