  Cell["These distributions live on graph types. Transporting a scalar field \
under Rule B additionally requires a rule for choosing the actual carrier \
edge to average. The next calculation moves to the complete N=8 GoG: blue \
encodes the exact 71-state distribution at t=12, while orange traces a \
separate 48-step sample.", "Text", TaggingRules -> 
    <|"GoGComputationalNotes" -> <|"ID" -> "DiffusionBoundary", 
       "Generated" -> True|>|>, CellTags -> {"GoGComputationalNotes", 
     "DiffusionBoundary"}, ExpressionUUID -> 
